# ============================================================
# ServSoftBagm — Professional .gitignore (Hardened 2026)
# ============================================================
# This repository will eventually handle real financial transactions,
# customer personal data, bank transfer instructions (QR + account),
# WhatsApp automation secrets, and production database credentials.
#
# RULE: When in doubt, DO NOT COMMIT IT.
# Every secret that reaches GitHub history is leaked forever.
#
# Philosophy:
# - Never commit real .env, real bank data, real tokens, or personal images.
# - Only commit EXAMPLE / TEMPLATE files with obvious placeholders.
# - Real operational secrets live only on the machine that needs them
#   (developer laptop, Render, VPS, Docker secrets, etc.).
#
# Backup of previous version: .gitignore.backup-before-2026-security-shield
# ============================================================

# ============================================================
# DEPENDENCIES & BUILDS
# ============================================================
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.local

# Turborepo cache
.turbo/

# Client (Vite/React)
apps/client/dist/
apps/client/.vite/
apps/client/.cache/

# Server
apps/server/dist/
apps/server/.cache/

# ============================================================
# ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS (CRITICAL FOR MONEY-HANDLING APP)
# ============================================================
# All real environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.*.template

# Server secrets (database, JWT, WhatsApp, Make.com, etc.)
apps/server/.env
apps/server/.env.*
!apps/server/.env.example
!apps/server/.env.*.example

# Client secrets
apps/client/.env
apps/client/.env.*
!apps/client/.env.example
!apps/client/.env.*.example

# Root level (sometimes used for docker-compose overrides)
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test

# ============================================================
# FINANCIAL & BANK DATA — NEVER COMMIT REAL INFORMATION
# ============================================================
# Real bank account details live only in apps/client/.env (see above).
# The QR image encodes the real account, so the actual file is never
# committed either — only local/deploy-time, like any other secret.
apps/client/public/assets/bank/*

# Only allow clearly marked non-sensitive files (safe to commit)
!apps/client/public/assets/bank/README.md
!apps/client/public/assets/bank/.gitkeep
!apps/client/public/assets/bank/EJEMPLO_*

# Future payment processor credentials (Stripe, PayU, Mercado Pago, etc.)
stripe*.json
payu*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# ============================================================
# PERSONAL MEDIA & BACKUPS (NEVER COMMIT ORIGINAL PHOTOS)
# ============================================================
apps/client/backup/
apps/client/backup/**
apps/client/public/personal-images/
apps/client/src/assets/images/personal/
*.original
*.backup

# ============================================================
# DATABASE FILES (LOCAL DEVELOPMENT)
# ============================================================
# SQLite
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
apps/server/runaway.db*
apps/server/*.sqlite*
apps/server/*.sqlite3*

# Local Postgres data (when using docker volumes)
postgres-data/
pgdata/
*.pgdata

# Fotos de evidencia subidas por el admin (disco local, temporal - ver
# apps/server/services/photoStorage.js para el aviso de migracion pendiente)
apps/server/uploads/

# ============================================================
# LOGS, CACHES, TEMPORARY
# ============================================================
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
apps/server/logs/
apps/client/logs/
*.tmp
*.temp
.cache/

# ============================================================
# IDE / EDITOR / OS
# ============================================================
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================================
# DOCKER & CONTAINER ARTIFACTS
# ============================================================
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.*.local.yml
*.dockerenv
volumes/
data/

# ============================================================
# AUTOMATION & EXTERNAL SERVICES SECRETS
# ============================================================
# Make.com / n8n webhook URLs and scenarios (real ones)
make-*.json
n8n-*.json
*.webhook

# WhatsApp Cloud / Evolution API permanent tokens
whatsapp-*.json
wa-*.key

# Future: Google Calendar service account, email SMTP passwords, etc.
google-*.json
service-account*.json

# ============================================================
# DOCUMENTATION & TEMPORARY ANALYSIS FILES (optional)
# ============================================================
# You can choose to commit or ignore these. Current policy: allow
# because they are useful for onboarding, but never put secrets inside.
# ANALYSIS.md
# PRODUCTION_ROADMAP.md
# etc. are currently committed — this is acceptable.

# ============================================================
# LOCAL WORKSPACE (never committed — auditoria, backups, evidencias, secretos)
# ============================================================
_local/

# ============================================================
# MISCELLANEOUS
# ============================================================
# Render / deployment specific
render.yaml.bak
.vercel/
.netlify/

# Large media that should be served from CDN or Git LFS later
*.mp4
*.mov
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ============================================================
# END OF HARDENED .gitignore
# ============================================================
# Last updated: 2026 — Security shield activated before any money features.
# Review this file every time you add a new secret type (new payment gateway, new automation, etc.).
